      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 5252                                                   (West Side)                                                   Nos 94 and 96 TL 0507 1/64              20.12.67. II                        GV 2. Early C19 front.  Brown brick with red dressings.  3 storeys  2 sash windows with glazing bars under flat arches.  Ground floor canted bay window.  lst floor window on right, formerly door, 2nd floor right hand former door under iron sway hoist  Cornice, parapet screening low-pitched roof. Nos 48 to 88 (even); Nos 94 to 100 (even) and Barn in garden of Nos 62 and 64 form a group. Listing NGR: TL0547207977"
    }
